{
  "work_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_ephrem",
  "source_path": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_ephrem.json",
  "source_language": "cop",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12": {
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-12",
      "script": "scripts.embed_eval.translate"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_ephrem#CopScr.pseudo-ephrem.000.0001",
      "source_sha256": "718876833c88210e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Suffering compels me to speak, and my unworthiness rebukes me, telling me to be silent."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_ephrem#CopScr.pseudo-ephrem.000.0031",
      "source_sha256": "f73c665030b0835c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He wants to become a philosopher before he has learned a syllable."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_ephrem#CopScr.pseudo-ephrem.000.0053",
      "source_sha256": "8254986a3ec836ae",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "When someone encounters a murderer on the road, his face changes and his heart trembles."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_ephrem#CopScr.pseudo-ephrem.000.0067",
      "source_sha256": "a997616b4ae33bec",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They killed the people, plundered the regions, and devastated the land."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_ephrem#CopScr.pseudo-ephrem.000.0069",
      "source_sha256": "9838e0ac352a749b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Brothers, let us repent, lest the wrath of God come upon us."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_ephrem#CopScr.pseudo-ephrem.000.0113",
      "source_sha256": "82e292d811787372",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "So let us be afraid, my beloved, and be prepared, lest they come upon me while we are unprepared, and no help comes to us."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_ephrem#CopScr.pseudo-ephrem.000.0117",
      "source_sha256": "2689f724152d8066",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Whoever wants to reign with Christ the King must not neglect himself, because the time has drawn near, according to what is written in Revelation."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_ephrem#CopScr.pseudo-ephrem.000.0133",
      "source_sha256": "cb10e9901715d6e8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Should a dark cloud come over us, with a storm, roaring winds, thunder, lightning, and afflictions on every side, we would have no way to go anywhere."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_ephrem#CopScr.pseudo-ephrem.000.0139",
      "source_sha256": "f6f88ec283287e10",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Let us understand that we are in a temporary lodging."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_ephrem#CopScr.pseudo-ephrem.000.0155",
      "source_sha256": "dc0f564b85fcdcf9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Do not let the passions of the flesh make us strangers to the city of Christ and cast us out of the bridal chamber, so that we fall down into the place of weeping and gnashing of teeth."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_ephrem#CopScr.pseudo-ephrem.001.0016",
      "source_sha256": "c6b7c31b075a785a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "When the habit of sleep grows stronger, it gains mastery over one's natural disposition."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_ephrem#CopScr.pseudo-ephrem.001.0027",
      "source_sha256": "7505d0ec69061437",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "In the midst of sleep, a night of wakefulness."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_ephrem#CopScr.pseudo-ephrem.001.0028",
      "source_sha256": "d94c720df1b1f700",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "In the midst of falsehood, [?] the truth."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_ephrem#CopScr.pseudo-ephrem.001.0029",
      "source_sha256": "31fc756aca1403c4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "In the midst of seeing with the eyes, blindness."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_ephrem#CopScr.pseudo-ephrem.001.0030",
      "source_sha256": "35371feb004c3b03",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For free choice is like a rudder."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_ephrem#CopScr.pseudo-ephrem.001.0031",
      "source_sha256": "d4307b09ec020512",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For this, in the blink of an eye, uproots evil habits and plants good virtues as it wishes, because it has overcome nature."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_ephrem#CopScr.pseudo-ephrem.001.0041",
      "source_sha256": "620bd1e1a1d70b61",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "These are: unbelief, giving up on yourself, hatred, envy, love of empty glory, anger, arrogance, slander, contentiousness, and things like these."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_ephrem#CopScr.pseudo-ephrem.001.0061",
      "source_sha256": "3f255dfce442a695",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But we are ungrateful and will reject him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_ephrem#CopScr.pseudo-ephrem.001.0066",
      "source_sha256": "130b57a99b916232",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He quickly listens to the weak person so that he does not become discouraged, and he grants the gift of the Spirit to those who persevere."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_ephrem#CopScr.pseudo-ephrem.001.0123",
      "source_sha256": "f46be60ea57ba944",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Blessed is the one who prepares himself, because he will receive everlasting life."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_ephrem#CopScr.pseudo-ephrem.001.0124",
      "source_sha256": "347773960beed4c5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Listen to me, beloved."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_ephrem#CopScr.pseudo-ephrem.001.0125",
      "source_sha256": "8421904dc9343429",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "How long will you remain neglectful? How long will you remain caught up in material concerns, when this life is like a temporary lodging?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_ephrem#CopScr.pseudo-ephrem.001.0126",
      "source_sha256": "accbf2bea61c4cd7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Pay attention now and understand what you have sent ahead of you to heaven."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_ephrem#CopScr.pseudo-ephrem.001.0127",
      "source_sha256": "19728c2f1c095701",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I beg you, do not go empty-handed, but send a gift ahead of you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_ephrem#CopScr.pseudo-ephrem.001.0128",
      "source_sha256": "c299c7a7e69db3f6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Send a prayer full of tears."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_ephrem#CopScr.pseudo-ephrem.001.0134",
      "source_sha256": "d44190cf2c084efb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 7,
      "text": "At least do not oppress your neighbor. Do not be arrogant toward him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_ephrem#CopScr.pseudo-ephrem.001.0137",
      "source_sha256": "02427bb443f8ca0f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 7,
      "text": "Will not the one who feeds the birds and the animals also feed you through his providence and the fruit of your hands?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_ephrem#CopScr.pseudo-ephrem.001.0143",
      "source_sha256": "6d5880d819593666",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 7,
      "text": "The time for repentance is set before you, yet you are neglectful and find fault with the lawgiver."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_ephrem#CopScr.pseudo-ephrem.001.0194",
      "source_sha256": "ac98dc4e5243a54d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 7,
      "text": "When those who know me observe me wearing the monastic habit, they look at me and call us blessed. They do not know that my inner self is full of lawlessness and every kind of impurity, and that I have forgotten God, who examines hearts and minds."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_ephrem#CopScr.pseudo-ephrem.002.0004",
      "source_sha256": "444c775e36af39e8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 7,
      "text": "You too, my son, put humility in your mouth, your heart, and your neck. For when you come to humility, it has its commandments."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_ephrem#CopScr.pseudo-ephrem.002.0026",
      "source_sha256": "f4b9a222e7da8510",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 7,
      "text": "I entrust their commandments to you at your beginning."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_ephrem#CopScr.pseudo-ephrem.002.0082",
      "source_sha256": "79acf46da7c9acad",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 7,
      "text": "For it is written: Through this, some received angels without knowing it."
    }
  ]
}
